    [
      "That transcript is encrypted while the call is connected and deleted when it ends (or within two hours at most); only whether Shield intervened is kept in call history.",
      "That transcript is encrypted while the call is connected and deleted when it ends. Any copy left behind expires two hours after its last update and is removed by daily cleanup, subject to service availability; only whether Shield intervened is kept in call history."
    ],
    [
      "Phone numbers are encrypted in temporary sign-in challenges.",
      "Phone numbers are encrypted in temporary sign-in challenges. Completed successful checks and completed checks that exhaust the attempt limit remove the encrypted phone and provider reference; expired or interrupted challenges are removed by daily cleanup, subject to service availability."
    ],
    [
      "Copies on other devices and provider cleanup records have separate cleanup paths.",
      "Copies on other devices and provider cleanup records have separate cleanup paths. Provider recording-erasure jobs remain until the provider copy is removed; completed jobs are removed by daily cleanup after the original call’s 30-day expiry."
